OL,5,G1700 5 News with Dan Walker
OL,6,G1800 Michael Portillo's Travel Diaries
OL,7,     FMichael spends a packed weekend on
OL,8,     Fthe stunning island of Sicily,
OL,9,     Flosing himself in the bustling
OL,10,     Fbackstreets of Palermo and
OL,11,     Finvestigating the island's
OL,12,     Fmurderous links to the Mafia.
OL,13,     F(Ep1)
OL,14,G1900 Police Interceptors
OL,15,     FA pair of potential car thieves
OL,16,     Fare chased by pursuit units and
OL,17,     Fdrone, then nicked by police
OL,18,     Fcanine Rocky and the firearms
OL,19,     Fsquad. And there's a report of a
OL,20,     Fman stealing fuel.
