OL,12,G2100 Police: Suspect No.1
OL,13,     FAfter a moped rider is stabbed 13
OL,14,     Ftimes in a daylight attack on
OL,15,     FEaster Sunday, armed officers
OL,16,     Fquickly stop the getaway car - but
OL,17,     Fdetectives must build a case
OL,18,     Fwithout the weapon.
